-item cib-nav-link-14 !normal-case border-0 my-0 block"><a class="px-5 lg:px-6 py-4 lg:py-6 block" aria-label="Go to section Acting as a global banking partner thanks to a common approach within the Crédit Agricole Group" href="/en/expertise/accompanying-you-your-specific-financing-needs/private-investment-banking#paragraph-066c1ad0-b508-4adf-8121-cfa5b2582b76"><span class="font-bold text-sm leading-5.5 lg:text-base lg:leading-6">Acting as a global banking partner thanks to a common approach within the Crédit Agricole Group</span></a></li><li id="link-paragraph-ee8c1395-da23-49fa-8165-a457534ca396" class="link-item cib-nav-link-14 !normal-case border-0 my-0 block"><a class="px-5 lg:px-6 py-4 lg:py-6 block" aria-label="Go to section A dedicated team of Private Investment Bankers" href="/en/expertise/accompanying-you-your-specific-financing-needs/private-investment-banking#paragraph-ee8c1395-da23-49fa-8165-a457534ca396"><span class="font-bold text-sm leading-5.5 lg:text-base lg:leading-6">A dedicated team of Private Investment Bankers</span></a></li><li id="link-paragraph-584cad2e-afa5-4251-8869-7bb43208ba6c" class="link-item cib-nav-link-14 !normal-case border-0 my-0 block"><a class="px-5 lg:px-6 py-4 lg:py-6 block" aria-label="Go to section Services for Family Holding Companies and Family Offices" href="/en/expertise/accompanying-you-your-specific-financing-needs/private-investment-banking#paragraph-584cad2e-afa5-4251-8869-7bb43208ba6c"><span class="font-bold text-sm leading-5.5 lg:text-base lg:leading-6">Services for Family Holding Companies and Family Offices</span></a></li><li id="link-paragraph-1448caa8-4cda-4d2c-8c5f-b5e23711e501" class="link-item cib-nav-link-14 !normal-case border-0 my-0 block"><a class="px-5 lg:px-6 py-4 lg:py-6 block" aria-label="Go to section A global and historical presence" href="/en/expertise/accompanying-you-your-specific-financing-needs/private-investment-banking#paragraph-1448caa8-4cda-4d2c-8c5f-b5e23711e501"><span class="font-bold text-sm leading-5.5 lg:text-base lg:leading-6">A global and historical presence</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full lg:max-w-none mx-auto"><div class="px-4 md:px-0"><div class="w-full -mt-12 lg:-mt-25 md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[95%] xl:max-w-[96%] 2.5xl:max-w-[1356px] lg:mx-0 mx-auto px-0 relative bg-surface dark:bg-dark-gray-000 min-h-[51px] lg:min-h-[101px]"><div><div class="md:px-11 pt-6 lg:pt-12 w-full px-4 lg:px-0 lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg mx-auto"><div class="mt-4 lg:mt-10 w-full px-0 mx-auto"><h1 class="text-2.5xl leading-10 lg:text-4.25xl lg:leading-15 font-bold uppercase mb-8 cib-text-major"><span>Private Investment Banking</span></h1><div class="font-semibold text-lg leading-8 lg:text-lg lg:leading-9 my-6"><div class="richtext-container"><p><span lang="EN-GB">Crédit Agricole CIB and Indosuez Wealth Management have combined their expertise to create Private Investment Banking, a new division dedicated to supporting high net worth individuals and family holding companies.</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-0 mx-auto"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center my-6 pt-4 border-t cib-border-gray-400 rs_skip"><div class="flex items-center lg:-mx-3"><div class="px-0 lg:px-3"><label class="text-base leading-6"><span>Share</span></label></div><ul class="flex items-center"><li class="px-3 flex items-center group"><span aria-label="Sharing on Linkedin, opens a new window" type="button"><cib-icon name="ic_linkedin" color="var(--cib-color-primary)" class="block rounded outline-2 group-focus-within:outline" aria-hidden="true"></cib-icon><span class="hidden">LinkedIn</span></span></li><li class="px-3 flex items-center group"><span aria-label="Sharing on Twitter, opens a new window" type="button"><cib-icon name="ic_x" color="var(--cib-color-primary)" class="block rounded outline-2 group-focus-within:outline" aria-hidden="true"></cib-icon><span class="hidden">Twitter</span></span></li><li class="px-3 flex items-center group"><span aria-label="Sharing on Facebook, opens a new window" type="button"><cib-icon name="ic_facebook" color="var(--cib-color-primary)" class="block rounded outline-2 group-focus-within:outline" aria-hidden="true"></cib-icon><span class="hidden">Facebook</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="my-4 lg:my-10 lg:max-w-[95%] xl:max-w-[96%] 2.5xl:max-w-[1356px] lg:mx-0 mx-auto px-0 pt-4 md:pt-8 lg:pt-10 2.5xl:pt-15 relative bg-surface dark:bg-dark-gray-000"><div class="w-full"><div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 !mb-4 lg:!mb-6" id="paragraph-066c1ad0-b508-4adf-8121-cfa5b2582b76"><h2 class="cib-text-major"><span class="block uppercase text-ellipsis text-xl leading-7.5 lg:text-3.75xl lg:leading-15 font-bold">Acting as a global banking partner thanks to a common approach within the Crédit Agricole Group</span></h2></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 w-full mx-auto"><div><div class="text-base leading-8.5 text-block-v1 richtext-container"><p>Combining the global expertise of senior bankers and private bankers, Private Investment Banking uses the services platform of Crédit Agricole CIB and Indosuez Wealth Management and the Crédit Agricole Group’s ecosystem. The team operates globally with the support of the Group's international network, with a presence in more than 45 countries.</p>

<p>Our <strong>Wealth Management</strong> division benefits from the major strengths of the Crédit Agricole Group:</p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5">
<li>A long-term strategy with stable and solid governance</li>
<li>A strong and solid balance sheet</li>
<li>An above-average rating</li>
<li>Significant financing capacity</li>
</ul>

<p>With a combined expertise, Crédit Agricole CIB and Indosuez Wealth Management have developed a comprehensive service through a dedicated team devoted to families in order to build long lasting partnerships and bring solutions that target their specific needs.<br>Our strategy to be rolled-out on Family businesses &amp; Individuals:</p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5">
<li>Increase knowledge of decision-makers and family members’ needs through a joint commercial approach Crédit Agricole CIB &amp; Indosuez Wealth Management.</li>
<li>Deliver a comprehensive offer leveraging Crédit Agricole CIB, Indosuez Wealth Management and other Crédit Agricole Group entities.<br>&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 !mb-4 lg:!mb-6 mt-16 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20 2.5xl:mt-25" id="paragraph-ee8c1395-da23-49fa-8165-a457534ca396"><h2 class="cib-text-major"><span class="block uppercase text-ellipsis text-xl leading-7.5 lg:text-3.75xl lg:leading-15 font-bold">A dedicated team of Private Investment Bankers</span></h2></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 w-full mx-auto"><div><div class="text-base leading-8.5 text-block-v1 richtext-container"><p>A dedicated team of Private Investment Bankers covers all the needs of family holding companies.</p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5">
<li>Our Private Investment Banking entity offers family businesses a single single entry-point through which they can access the group's various entities</li>
<li>Our team of specialists covers all the needs of family businesses, from individual shareholders to Family Holding Companies.</li>
<li>Our comprehensive approach relies on Crédit Agricole CIB's and Indosuez Wealth Management's local bankers with a dedicated point of contact around the world.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15"><span class="block relative max-w-[744px] w-full"><img src="/_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=0&amp;q=75" srcSet="/_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-10%2Fschema_0.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" sizes="100vw" alt="schéma Wealth Management" width="0" height="0" loading="lazy" class="w-full lg:w-auto h-auto text-transparent  "/></span><div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 !mb-4 lg:!mb-6 mt-16 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20 2.5xl:mt-25" id="paragraph-584cad2e-afa5-4251-8869-7bb43208ba6c"><h2 class="cib-text-major"><span class="block uppercase text-ellipsis text-xl leading-7.5 lg:text-3.75xl lg:leading-15 font-bold">Services for Family Holding Companies and Family Offices</span></h2></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 w-full mx-auto"><div><div class="text-base leading-8.5 text-block-v1 richtext-container"><p><strong>A Family Holding Company is a company :</strong></p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5">
<li>Owned by a high net worth individual or family members</li>
<li>With a historical principal company - which is often still fully or partially owned, or which was sold at some point in the past</li>
<li>Which holds a diversified portfolio of investments</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>A Family Office :&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5">
<li>Is an organisation that manages the financial and personal interests of a wealthy family</li>
<li>It provides advice to family members on investment, budgets, insurance, taxation, real estate, trusts, accounting, legal affairs, risk management, etc.</li>
<li>Is generally fully owned and controlled by the family members in question Family Offices manage individual issues and are therefore mainly backed up by private bankers.<br>A Single Family Office (SFO) serves a single family while a Multi-Family Office (MFO) serves multiple families.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 !mb-4 lg:!mb-6 mt-16 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20 2.5xl:mt-25" id="paragraph-1448caa8-4cda-4d2c-8c5f-b5e23711e501"><h2 class="cib-text-major"><span class="block uppercase text-ellipsis text-xl leading-7.5 lg:text-3.75xl lg:leading-15 font-bold">A global and historical presence</span></h2></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15 w-full mx-auto"><div><div class="text-base leading-8.5 text-block-v1 richtext-container"><p>We offer a comprehensive approach to <strong>wealth and asset management,</strong> supported by Crédit Agricole CIB's and <a href="https://ca-indosuez.com/" target="_blank">Indosuez Wealth Management<span class="sr-only"> Will open in a new tab </span></a>'s local bankers with a dedicated point of contact around the world. Our global and long-standing presence allows us to support our clients and the Group with their cross-border needs.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] lg:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[95%] 2.5xl:max-w-screen-1.75lg px-4 md:px-0 mx-auto"><div class="mb-8 lg:mb-10 2.5xl:mb-15"><span class="block relative max-w-[744px] w-full"><img src="/_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=0&amp;q=75" srcSet="/_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbo-en-instit-cacib.adsi.credit-agricole.fr%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2F2023-08%2FWealth%2520Management%2520map.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" sizes="100vw" alt="Mapmonde" width="0" height="0" loading="lazy" class="w-full lg:w-auto h-auto text-transparent  "/></span><div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:max-w-[96%] l